{"format":1,"id":"appb","label":"B","title":"R Quick Reference","part":"B","blocks":[{"t":"prose","label":"","role":"text","html":"<p>Every function used in an <strong>In R</strong> box, with the package it comes from and the sections where it is used. Base-R helpers (c(), mean(), table(), and so on) are left out. All examples read the synthetic teaching datasets described in <a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c01-s06\" data-sec=\"c01-s06\" data-num=\"1.6\">§1.6</a>.</p>\n<table>\n\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Function</th>\n<th>Package</th>\n<th>Used in</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>abline()</code></td>\n<td>base R</td>\n<td><a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c16-s03\" data-sec=\"c16-s03\" data-num=\"16.3.5\">§16.3.5</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ageadjust.direct()</code></td>\n<td>epitools</td>\n<td><a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c07-s04\" data-sec=\"c07-s04\" data-num=\"7.4.2\">§7.4.2</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AIC()</code></td>\n<td>base R</td>\n<td><a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c15-s01\" data-sec=\"c15-s01\" data-num=\"15.1.2\">§15.1.2</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>alpha()</code></td>\n<td>psych</td>\n<td><a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c16-s03\" data-sec=\"c16-s03\" data-num=\"16.3.1.1\">§16.3.1.1</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>anova()</code></td>\n<td>base R</td>\n<td><a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c12-s04\" data-sec=\"c12-s04\" data-num=\"12.4.5\">§12.4.5</a>, <a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c15-s01\" data-sec=\"c15-s01\" data-num=\"15.1.2\">§15.1.2</a>, <a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c15-s02\" data-sec=\"c15-s02\" data-num=\"15.2.2\">§15.2.2</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>aov()</code></td>\n<td>base R</td>\n<td><a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c09-s05\" data-sec=\"c09-s05\" data-num=\"9.5.2\">§9.5.2</a>, <a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c09-s05\" data-sec=\"c09-s05\" data-num=\"9.5.3\">§9.5.3</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>as.matrix()</code></td>\n<td>Matrix</td>\n<td><a class=\"xref\" href=\"#c14-s08\" data-sec=\"c14-s08\" data-num=\"14.8\">§14.8</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>as.vector()<